  "brief": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "A customer-satisfaction model inspired by the ACSI structure (SYNTHETIC data, not ACSI data): customer expectations (CE), perceived quality (PQ), perceived value (PV), satisfaction (SAT) and loyalty (LOY). All items were answered on a 10-point scale from 1 (\"very poor\") to 10 (\"excellent\"). Management asks which driver to prioritise to raise loyalty."
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "The model was imported without scale endpoints. Some items were never answered with 1 in this sample."
    }
  ],
